      "topic": "Boats & Streams",
      "q": "A boat's speed in still water is 10 km/h and the stream flows at 2 km/h. How long does it take to go 36 km downstream?",
      "options": [
        "2.5 hours",
        "3 hours",
        "3.5 hours",
        "4.5 hours"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Downstream speed = 10 + 2 = 12 km/h. Time = 36 / 12 = 3 hours."
