      "q": "The ages of A and B are in the ratio 4 : 5. After 6 years the ratio will be 5 : 6. What is A's present age?",
      "options": [
        "20 years",
        "24 years",
        "28 years",
        "30 years"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "(4x + 6)/(5x + 6) = 5/6 → 24x + 36 = 25x + 30 → x = 6. A = 4 × 6 = 24 years."
